@guide H_Barrens
@name The Barrens (Crossroads)
@faction Horde
@levels 11-22
@zone The Barrens
@chapter Azeroth
@desc The Crossroads, Ratchet, the oases, the Kolkar and Razormane centaur, the Venture Co. and Camp Taurajo. All four Horde starting routes meet here.
@next H_Stonetalon

